---
import InnerLayout from '../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout title="Terms of Service | Nixora" description="Nixora Terms of Service. Terms governing the use of Nixora CLI, managed services, and early access platform.">

  <div style="padding:4rem 2rem 4rem;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2.5rem;">
    
    <div>
      <div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:#52525b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="section-headline">Terms of <span class="accent">Service</span></h1>
      <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:#71717a;margin-top:0.75rem;font-family:'Fira Code',monospace;">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2rem;color:#a1a1aa;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;">
      
      <section style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin:0;">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          By installing the Nixora CLI (<code style="font-family:'Fira Code',monospace;color:#a78bfa;background:rgba(167,139,250,0.08);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;">nixora-cli</code>), accessing our website, or using our managed deployment control plane, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our CLI or services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin:0;">2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          Nixora provides a developer CLI tool and managed infrastructure platform designed to automate containerization, deployment, HTTPS provisioning, and lifecycle management for AI-generated applications.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin:0;">3. Account & Early Access</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          Access to Nixora early tester builds, waitlists, and managed compute infrastructure is provided on an invitation and availability basis. You are responsible for maintaining the security of your authentication tokens and deployment environments.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin:0;">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          You agree not to use Nixora services to deploy malicious software, execute unauthorized data mining, perform distributed denial-of-service (DDoS) attacks, or violate any applicable laws or third-party rights.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin:0;">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          You retain full ownership of all source code, software, and application assets generated by you or your AI coding agents. Nixora retains all rights, titles, and interests in the Nixora CLI, infrastructure orchestration engine, brand assets, and platform services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin:0;">6. Disclaimers & Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          During early access and pre-release phases, Nixora services are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, express or implied. Nixora shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from platform downtime or data loss.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.75rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600;margin:0;">7. Contact Information</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          If you have questions regarding these Terms of Service, please contact us at <a href="mailto:ceo@nixora.co.in" style="color:#a78bfa;text-decoration:none;">ceo@nixora.co.in</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

  </div>

</InnerLayout>
